WEBVTT

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.240
Shindan Loaded!

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:47.040
Shotgun Blast, Blue Thorn!

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.120
Resound, Red Needle!

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:50.830
Raven Black!

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:16.160
It has no gaps.

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.860
Is that true, Steak?

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:21.720
God damn it...

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:24.910
It's developed a resistance to shindans now?

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.540
W-W-What'll we do now?

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:33.040
We're gonna stop it! No matter what!

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.550
Leave it to me, Lag!

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:45.450
Niche...

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:08.960
We'll stop it, no matter what...

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:15.630
Battle in Yuusari Central!

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.640
Show's over, folks!

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:39.740
Listen up, blokes!

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:42.510
We're gonna finish evacuating everyone,

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:44.730
by the time this "Cabernet" gaichuu 
gets here, by hook or by crook!

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:46.450
Leave it to us, Sarah!

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:48.290
We'll show you the pride of us dingos!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:49.240
Here, here!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.680
Hey, hurry up!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.200
Wait a second, okay?

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:57.590
I have to take this, at least...

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:01.260
Let's go.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:05.510
Whoa...

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:09.430
I've got to draw a record of this...

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:48.370
It's better than expected! It metamorphosed 
into a gaichuu without any gaps.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:49.440
Yes.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:51.960
It's all thanks to your work.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:58.590
But it was you who thought to bring the ones 
unable to become spirit to the Bee Hive.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:01.550
There are a great number of letters there.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:05.850
By devouring the strong hearts gathered 
as one by Signal and Signaless,

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:09.300
together with the great amount of 
heart contained in those letters,

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.990
the Cabernet's power will 
become overwhelming.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.310
I can see it!

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:40.540
Why?

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:41.980
What is it?

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:44.740
There's no sign of any people here.

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:49.190
Nor is the Cabernet extending 
its tentacles to absorb heart.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.200
Too bad about that.

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.610
Ringleader of Reverse, Lawrence!

00:05:56.610 --> 00:06:00.710
Marauders Caribs Garrard, Hazle Valentine!

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:03.460
You are under arrest.

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:05.240
Aria Link?

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.000
What is the meaning of this?

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:10.610
The Bee Hive has already 
been completely emptied.

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:15.720
Impossible! The ones who were unable to 
become spirit should have been transported there!

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.050
Indeed they were.

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:23.020
However, that was not for the purpose 
of feeding their hearts to the Cabernet.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:26.380
It was to shelter them 
and treat their illness.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:33.780
Once they were able to move 
again, they were all evacuated.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.500
Along with the workers from the Bee 
Hive and the citizens of Central.

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:45.160
Why? How could you manage such a thing?

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:52.440
Signal! Signaless!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:55.310
You two betrayed me?!

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:57.750
We have betrayed no one.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:01.480
We simply used your plan.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:04.780
The two of you should despise the government

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:07.820
for what it did to your bodies and 
the death of your little brother!

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:11.450
Our hatred of the government has not changed.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:15.800
That being said, we cannot allow 
anyone's heart to be sacrificed.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:21.500
All that would do is increase the number of 
people facing the same sadness we brothers suffer...

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:24.340
You fools!

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.840
You may have been able to block our plan,

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:51.360
but do you have a way to stop the Cabernet?

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:53.280
Of course.

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:03.620
That's...

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:10.400
Doctor, is that...

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:15.280
The legendary creature 
from the tales up North...

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:16.900
The Maka!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.370
W-Why is the Maka here?

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.830
Looks like we made it.

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:30.900
Lloyd! How did you...

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:36.320
I took a quick ride up to Blue Notes Blues.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.830
I beg of you.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:55.840
What'll you do, Caribs Garrard?

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.070
Not bad, Lloyd.

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:15.680
I'll give you praise for 
bringing the Maka here.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:19.400
But the Cabernet is invincible now.

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:23.240
Plus, we also have this.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:27.270
That dust... it's powdered Spirit Amber!

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:41.050
What?

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:49.980
What?

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:11.010
Could they be luring Gaichuu here?

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.200
Hold it!

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.370
Wait! We have more important things now...

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:32.200
Why are there so many gaichuu here?

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:34.710
The Cabernet alone's annoying enough!

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:37.150
Leave this to us, Lag.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:39.410
You handle the Cabernet.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:45.330
Right!

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:48.370
Connor, we're going too!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:49.980
Right!

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:14.560
Thank you...

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:19.360
No. It is I who should thank you, Sylvette.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:23.730
Take care of these children.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.440
I must go.

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:30.080
Because I am his dingo.

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:38.590
Could that be the person 
brother cares so much about?

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:58.860
At this rate, the Maka will...

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.240
Let us go, Lag Seeing!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:08.240
The person known as Gauche 
Suede no longer exists.

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:15.180
What is it?

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:20.520
But our shindans won't work 
against the Cabernet...

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:31.810
Niche!

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:40.150
I will protect you, Lag! No matter what!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.500
Niche, you've done enough!

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:43.400
I won't quit!

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.960
Niche!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:49.070
If I lose you, too...

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:50.150
Lag...

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:53.640
Gauche is no more!

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:57.980
So if I lose you as well...

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:00.930
I will always stay with you, Lag.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:04.050
And Gauche is here, Lag!

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:09.800
He's Noir, but he's Gauche!

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:14.350
Gauche, even though he's Noir?

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:16.880
Sister of mine!

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.980
Niche's sister!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.530
Already winded?

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:31.280
Once more, in the same place!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.540
Niche!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.210
Roda!

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:48.800
Let's go!

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:53.720
I need to apologize for what I said earlier.

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:58.980
You are not a failure as a dingo.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:02.210
Neither are you, Roda!

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:26.670
You delivered my mother's heart to me...

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:32.120
I will risk my life to deliver 
your heart to Lag Seeing.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:35.490
Because that is the job of a Letter Bee.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.480
You are a Letter Bee.

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:47.480
It might be true that the person 
known as Gauche Suede is no more.

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:52.640
But you are still the same 
person who once risked his life

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:56.490
to deliver me as a letter 
when I was all alone.

00:14:57.130 --> 00:15:02.000
You are the strong and kind person 
I've looked up to ever since!

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:06.940
Let us deliver our hearts.

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:08.220
Can they reach it?

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:13.200
We'll take the despair the Cabernet 
is trying to bring, and change it...

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:16.560
...into hope!

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:22.810
Let us deliver it!

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:25.520
Shindan Loaded!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:31.820
Resound, my Heart!

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:54.010
Did it work?

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:21.670
They did it...

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:27.350
Brother...

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:28.770
Lag!

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.100
Niche...

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:37.180
Thank you, Niche. It's all thanks to you.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:42.430
Of course! Because I am your dingo, Lag!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:46.190
Thank you so much for your help!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.840
I am glad you are safe.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:56.740
And I, you.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:00.200
Looks like you've still got it.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.960
But you have no intention 
of coming back, do you?

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:09.500
I am sorry.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:12.670
Lag!

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:16.960
Lawrence!

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:21.290
Cabernet, do not let this end here!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.560
What is he doing?

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.380
He couldn't be... He's...

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:40.030
Lawrence is a being whose heart has been 
enhanced... One who was unable to become spirit.

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:42.790
He's going to use that heart...

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:56.080
Cabernet, send a message to 
those vain humans in Akatsuki!

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:02.410
To create a world of true equality...

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:07.600
I must rid this world of 
that despicable light...

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:15.610
Amberground will be reborn... Reverse...

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:51.990
Noir!

00:18:58.560 --> 00:18:59.680
Noir!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.200
Noir!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:08.740
Noir?

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:09.960
Noir!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:19.360
Noir!!

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:46.620
Next: Heart's Light
